sequenceDiagram
  actor Resident
  actor Admin
  participant MaintenanceController
  participant MaintenanceService
  participant MaintRepo as MaintenanceRepository
  participant FinancialRepo
  participant NotificationRepo
  participant Dispatch as NotificationDispatchService

  Resident->>MaintenanceController: POST /maintenance
  MaintenanceController->>MaintenanceService: CreateAsync(request)
  MaintenanceService->>MaintRepo: Add maintenance request (Open)
  MaintenanceService->>NotificationRepo: Add Admin alert
  MaintenanceService->>Dispatch: DispatchAsync(notification, external=true)
  MaintenanceService-->>MaintenanceController: MaintenanceRequestDto
  MaintenanceController-->>Resident: 201 Created

  Admin->>MaintenanceController: PUT /maintenance/{id}/status
  MaintenanceController->>MaintenanceService: UpdateStatusAsync(...)
  alt Completed and expense informed
    MaintenanceService->>FinancialRepo: Add maintenance expense record
  end
  MaintenanceService->>MaintRepo: Update request status and metadata
  MaintenanceService-->>MaintenanceController: MaintenanceRequestDto
  MaintenanceController-->>Admin: 200 OK
